'smith-haut-lafitte|ch-teau-smith-haut-lafitte-blanc|2020':{oak:50,yld:29,months:'12',press:{'Decanter':'96','Falstaff':'94-96','James Suckling':'95-96','Vinous':'93-95','Wine Advocate':'94-96','Yves Beck':'95-96'},src:'2020-SHL-BLANC-FR-avec-notes.pdf',blend:{SB:90,SEM:5,SG:5}},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2015':{blend:{CS:50,ME:50},yld:35,months:'14',src:'Les-Hauts-de-Smith-rouge-2015-Fiche-technique.pdf',oak:20,pick:{ALL:'09-14|'},note:'The year 2015 was marked by a long drought from March to July and a month of August rather cool and wet, causing early maturation while maintaining a beautiful freshness. Thanks to a precocious water stress we have a large production of tannins and a beautiful maturation of them. The harvest lasted for 4 weeks, slowly, following the tannin maturation process. We harvested our grapes at their optimum. The harvest of the red grapes started on September 14th with the young Merlot grapes and on 22nd of September for the old Merlot vines. Then, the Petit Verdot on October 2nd, the Cabernet Sauvignon from 5th to 12th of October and we finished with our Cabernet Franc. It was a pleasure to harvest these perfectly ripped and balanced grapes, with a beautiful weather… Comments by Fabien Teitgen, Technical Director Les Hauts de Smith Rouge 2015 has a beautiful very dark red, very dense. The nose expresses very nice fresh fruits, raspberry, cherry, fresh strawberry, with smoke, liquorice and cinamon notes. The palate is concentrated, smoothy, dense with nice tanins texture : hamonious and smoothy. The wine is very charming, revealing lovely fresh red fruits, sweet spices notes (badiane, cinnamon, liquorice), smooky notes very caracteristical of our gravel terroir.'},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2016':{blend:{CS:40,ME:60},yld:36,months:'14',src:'Les-Hauts-de-Smith-rouge-2016-Fiche-technique.pdf',note:'Un débourrement précoce, des alertes au gel deuxième quinzaine d’avril, Mai et Juin chauds humides accompagnés d’une forte pression mildiou, un été très sec…cette année s’annonçait compliqué, avec ces à-coup climatiques...'},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2017':{blend:{CS:40,ME:60},yld:36,months:'14',press:{'Decanter':'90-92','Neal Martin':'90-92'},src:'2017-HDS-ROUGE-FR.pdf',oak:20},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2018':{blend:{CS:40,ME:60},months:'14',press:{'Decanter':'92-93'},src:'2018-HDS-ROUGE-FR.pdf'},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2019':{blend:{CS:40,ME:60},yld:36,months:'14',press:{'Decanter':'92','Falstaff':'91','James Suckling':'92-93','Jancis Robinson':'16','Neal Martin':'90-92','Vinous':'91-93','Wine Advocate':'90-92','Yves Beck':'90-92'},src:'2019-HDS-Rouge-FR.pdf'},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2020':{blend:{CS:40,ME:60},yld:30,months:'14',press:{'Decanter':'92','Falstaff':'92-94','James Suckling':'92-93','Neal Martin':'90-92','Vinous':'92-94'},src:'2020-HDS-ROUGE-FR-avec-notes.pdf',oak:20},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith|2021':{blend:{CS:40,ME:60},yld:22,months:'14',src:'2021-HDS-ROUGE-FR.pdf',oak:20},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith-white|2015':{note:'The year 2015 was marked by a long drought from March to July and a rather cool and wet August, leading to an early maturation while preserving a beautiful freshness. The freshness of the temperatures, especially nocturnal, during the maturation of the grapes has preserved the acidity essential to the balance and the tension of our white wines. We can also note a great homogeneity of bud break, flowering, veraison, characteristic of this vintage and which is a very good qualitative basis !! The grape harvest began on 31 August with the young Sauvignon, then from 7 to 15 September for the old vines, 14 September for the Sauvignon grays and finally the Sémillon on 18 September.',blend:{SB:100},oak:50,months:'10',src:'Haut-de-Smith_Fiche-Technique-Blanc-2015-1.pdf',pick:{ALL:'09-07|09-15'},yld:30},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith-white|2016':{blend:{SB:100},yld:30,months:'10',src:'Les-Hauts-de-Smith-blanc-2016-Fiche-technique-neutre.pdf',pick:{ALL:'09-24|'},note:'Un mois d’avril qui flirte avec le gel, un printemps frais et humide, un mois de juin arrosé, le millésime était mal parti… Un été chaud et sec, des nuits fraîches, une pluie nécessaire début septembre et on a redécouvert ce millésime élégant, aromatique, frais, superbe !!!'},
'smith-haut-lafitte|hauts-de-smith-white|2017':{blend:{SB:100},yld:30,months:'10',press:{'James Suckling':'93-94','Wine Advocate':'93-94'},src:'2017-HDS-BLANC-FR.pdf',oak:50},
